expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
List every note, including one whose frontmatter does not parse

Usage: mnemex list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --kind <KIND>        Restrict to one kind
      --project <PROJECT>  Keep only the notes whose `project` names this id
      --json               Emit the versioned envelope
  -h, --help               Print help
